Third party material in VOLO
============================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers VOLO's own code and generated data. It does
not cover the following, which belong to other people.


Astra's Load Order Dividers
---------------------------

Distributed here as public/downloads/astras-dividers.zip, and identified by
UUID in client/src/lib/dividers.json and masterlist/separator-mods.json.

Made by Astralities (https://forums.nexusmods.com/profile/106303673-astralities/)
for their own playthroughs, and included with their permission on the condition
that credit is given. They are not VOLO's to relicense. Anyone redistributing
them should ask Astralities directly rather than relying on the MIT grant above.


Mod names
---------

Mod names throughout the masterlist, the reference catalogues and the submitted
corpus belong to their authors. They are reproduced exactly as written, because
they are matched against what players have installed and altering them breaks
the match.


Submitted load orders
---------------------

Files under "Load Orders - Public Submitted" were contributed by players who
chose to make them public. They are lists of mod names and identifiers rather
than creative work, and they exist so the sorter can learn from real,
played-on orders.
